{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CubeScape</strong> is a first-person atmospheric experience about self-reflection, perception, and a vanishing reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982210/extras/f13c49d905cf35c27ea0f1d2c9e0bbeb.poster.avif?t=1753577052\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982210/extras/f13c49d905cf35c27ea0f1d2c9e0bbeb.webm?t=1753577052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982210/extras/f13c49d905cf35c27ea0f1d2c9e0bbeb.mp4?t=1753577052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You enter a gallery named <strong>Tesseract</strong>, but soon the exhibits fade, the walls collapse, and you\u2019re left wandering strange cubic worlds \u2014 each obeying its own logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore surreal spaces, interact with mysterious objects, trigger mechanisms, and uncover symbolic links between your surroundings and your inner self. This journey won\u2019t give you clear answers \u2014 it will make you ask the right questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982210/extras/69e2965affeae5c99d77933fb69413d9.poster.avif?t=1753577052\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982210/extras/69e2965affeae5c99d77933fb69413d9.webm?t=1753577052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982210/extras/69e2965affeae5c99d77933fb69413d9.mp4?t=1753577052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First-person exploration with full movement freedom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with objects, activate mechanisms, affect the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story told through space and sound \u2014 no dialogue, no HUD</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Philosophical themes: memory, perception, inner transformation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Surreal, dreamlike environments built on geometric abstraction</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/982210?t=1753577052","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/982210?t=1753577052","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982210/9857ff80f867f98129c52be65db12ee8223737cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753577052","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982210/9857ff80f867f98129c52be65db12ee8223737cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753577052","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3821480,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CubeScape</strong> is a first-person atmospheric experience about self-reflection, perception, and a vanishing reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982210/extras/f13c49d905cf35c27ea0f1d2c9e0bbeb.poster.avif?t=1753577052\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982210/extras/f13c49d905cf35c27ea0f1d2c9e0bbeb.webm?t=1753577052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982210/extras/f13c49d905cf35c27ea0f1d2c9e0bbeb.mp4?t=1753577052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br